d a line of noisy <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t4-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> attached to them.</li><li>could be triangular, rectangular or <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t4-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> shaped.</li><li>had patterns made from clay mixed with <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t4-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> oil.</li><li>sometimes had human-head masks with <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t4-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and a tattoo.</li></ul><p><strong>Purpose and function of kites:</strong></p><ul><li>a way of sending <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t4-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> to the gods</li><li>a way of telling other villages that a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t4-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> was necessary</li><li>a means of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-official-guide-t4-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> if enemies were coming.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div 